This can be easily addressed by moving the Wait outside
the loop.
Example (Moby): Mutual blocking between channels and mutexes
Another example in Moby showcases a mixed channel-lock leak:
type (
    State struct {
        Health *Health
    }
    Container struct {
        sync.Mutex
        State *State
